						<li data-disable-click='0'><a href="/en/">European Commodity Clearing</a></li><li data-disable-click='0'><a href="/en/about-ecc">About ECC</a></li><li data-disable-click='0'><a href="/en/about-ecc/company">Company</a></li><li class="active">Careers</li>
