	<div class="intraNav" id="33705" data-intranav="Welcome to ECC"></div><section class="mt-xl-2 mt-md-1 mt-1">
	<div class="text-container">
		
				<div class="container">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="col-xl-8 offset-xl-2">
							
								<h1>Welcome to ECC AG</h1>
							
							<p>
								<span class="note">
									Hello from ECC, the leading clearing house for energy and commodity products in Europe. As part of EEX Group, we have our roots in Leipzig and are active in 25 locations worldwide. We provide security for our customers, by ensuring the physical and financial settlement of transactions for EEX Group and other partner exchanges. What makes us so successful? We are a team of individual experts that drive forward exciting projects while sharing experiences, celebrating success and creating memories, together.
								</span>
							</p>
							
							
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				
	</div>
</section><section class="vidBgWrapper  mt-xl-4 mt-md-3 mt-2 ">
	<div class="grid-teaser-50-50-video ">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				
					<div class="col-lg-8">
						<div class="video-container" data-url="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/4iuoMavUVkI?rel=0">
							<div class="play"></div>
							
								<img class="thumbnail" src="/fileadmin/Global/Youtube-Thumbnails/Clearing_at_ECC_About.png" width="1057" height="592" alt="" title="Clearing at ECC" />
							
						</div>
					</div>
				

				<div class="col-lg-4">
					<div>
						<h3>Clearing at ECC – Do you want to know how clearing works?</h3>
						<p>European Commodity Clearing (ECC) is a central clearing house which specialises in energy and commodity products.<br> <br> To learn more about what we are clearing, and what happens if the buyer or seller drops out of the transaction, watch our short video which gives a general overview of ECCs services.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><sup><strong>Notice:</strong><br> To activate the video, please click on the picture. Please note that after activation your data will be forwarded to YouTube.</sup></p>
					</div>
				</div>

				
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

