<section class="mt-xl-5 mt-md-4 mt-3">
	<div class="text-container">
		
				<div class="container">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="col-xl-8 offset-xl-2">
							
								<h2>Job Openings</h2>
							
							
							
							<p>We are looking for committed colleagues, ideally with experience in the energy or the finance sector. Applications from people with disabilities are expressedly welcome and will be given preferential treatment if they are equally suitable.</p>
<p>While the EEX Group headquarters is located in Leipzig, our flexible mobile working offers our colleagues the possibility to work from all places within Germany. If you're interested in joining our team remotely, we are happy to discuss which model suits you best.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				
	</div>
</section>
