<section class="   ">
	<div class="container">
		
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-xl-6">
				
					<!-- Bild oben oder kein Bild - Text unten -->
		
				<div class="image-text-teaser bg-green ">
					<div class="teaser-image" style="background-image:url(/fileadmin/EEX_Group/About/Values/Respect_Sophie_1570x727.jpg);"></div>
					<div class="image-text-teaser-container">
						
						<h3><strong>Respect</strong></h3>
<h5><strong>We value people and protect our environment.</strong></h5>
<p>Respect is the common thread uniting all our ambitions: preserving nature’s resources allows us to supply energy responsibly on a global scale. Celebrating the diversity and skills of our people promotes our open culture. Big and small efforts are recognised to empower our teams.</p>
						
						
					</div>
				</div>
				
			</div>

			<div class="col-xl-6">
				
					<!-- Bild oben oder kein Bild - Text unten -->
		
				<div class="image-text-teaser bg-sky-blue ">
					<div class="teaser-image" style="background-image:url(/fileadmin/EEX_Group/About/Values/Trustworthiness_Tim_1570x724px.jpg);"></div>
					<div class="image-text-teaser-container">
						
						<h3><strong>Trustworthiness</strong></h3>
<h5>We lead and collaborate with integrity.</h5>
<p>Safe trading means being transparent with all our stakeholders, external and internal. We take pride in <strong>transparent collaboration </strong>within our organisation and are continuously committed to <strong>fulfilling regulatory requirements</strong> to provide full accountability for our clients.</p>
						
						
					</div>
				</div>
				
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>	

<!-- 6_6 -->

	


	


	


	


<section class="   ">
	<div class="container">
		
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-xl-6">
				
					<!-- Bild oben oder kein Bild - Text unten -->
		
				<div class="image-text-teaser bg-dark-blue ">
					<div class="teaser-image" style="background-image:url(/fileadmin/EEX_Group/About/Values/Forward_Thinking_1570x724px.jpg);"></div>
					<div class="image-text-teaser-container">
						
						<h3><strong>Forward thinking</strong></h3>
<h5><strong>We translate our visions into action.</strong></h5>
<p>Thinking <strong>one step ahead </strong>has shaped our growth from the very beginning. This mindset requires dedication, creativity, and, most of all, passion. We are passionate and proud of being the first movers in our industry and constantly encourage our visionaries.</p>
						
						
					</div>
				</div>
				
			</div>

			<div class="col-xl-6">
				
					<!-- Bild oben oder kein Bild - Text unten -->
		
				<div class="image-text-teaser bg-purple ">
					<div class="teaser-image" style="background-image:url(/fileadmin/EEX_Group/About/Values/Customer_Orientation_Anja_1570x724px.jpg);"></div>
					<div class="image-text-teaser-container">
						
						<h3><strong>Customer orientation</strong></h3>
<h5><strong>We connect globally and locally.</strong></h5>
<p>We adapt to our client's needs on a global scale whilst maintaining local roots for tailored solutions. We have established reliable, secure trading platforms worldwide with strong, lasting relationships with our partners.</p>
						
						
					</div>
				</div>
				
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
